
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="author-page">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND ACEGATE ECE</span>
          <h1>From a Small Village to a Journey in Engineering, Research & Technology.</h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            Every journey has a beginning. Mine started with limited
            resources, ambitious dreams and a determination to keep learning.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#journey" class="btn btn-primary">Explore My Journey</a>
            <a href="#acegate" class="btn btn-outline">Why ACEgate ECE?</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="profile-card">
          <div class="profile-placeholder">AK</div>
          <h2>Aklesh Kumar</h2>
          <p>Founder & Creator of ACEgate ECE</p>
          <span class="profile-tag">Electronics & Communication Engineer</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
    <section class="section container" id="journey">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">MY STORY</span>
        <h2>Hello, Students and Future Engineers!</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>
          I am Aklesh Kumar, an Electronics and Communication Engineering
          professional, researcher and lifelong learner. I created
          ACEgate ECE with a vision of making quality engineering education
          and GATE preparation resources accessible to aspiring engineers.
        </p>

        <p>
          I come from a rural village and a financially modest family.
          My journey has included competitive examination setbacks,
          professional experiences, research opportunities and academic
          achievements. There was no perfectly planned roadmap.
          I learned, adapted, made mistakes and continued moving forward.
        </p>

        <p>
          I believe that our starting point does not determine our
          destination. Discipline, consistency and the willingness
          to learn can open doors to opportunities we once thought
          were beyond our reach.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- QUICK ACHIEVEMENTS -->
    <section class="achievement-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading center">
          <span class="eyebrow">MILESTONES</span>
          <h2>Some Important Milestones</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="achievement-grid">
          <div class="achievement-card">
            <strong>3rd</strong>
            <span>Overall M.Tech batch rank</span>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-card">
            <strong>3 Times</strong>
            <span>GATE ECE qualified: 2024, 2025, 2026</span>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-card">
            <strong>AIR 2</strong>
            <span>KIIT Entrance Examination</span>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-card">
            <strong>3 nm</strong>
            <span>Nanoscale transistor research</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TIMELINE -->
    <section class="section container">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <span class="eyebrow">MY EDUCATIONAL & PROFESSIONAL JOURNEY</span>
        <h2>The Journey So Far</h2>
        <p>Every experience contributed something valuable to my growth.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline">

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">EARLY ACADEMIC YEARS</span>
            <h3>Competitive Entrance Examinations</h3>
            <p>
              My academic journey began with preparation for several
              competitive entrance examinations. I appeared for:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>IPU Entrance Examination</li>
              <li>WBJEE – 95/100 in Mathematics</li>
              <li>KIITEE – All India Rank 2</li>
              <li>AKTU Entrance Examination</li>
              <li>JEE Main</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              These experiences helped me build my academic foundation
              and eventually pursue engineering at IIIT Manipur.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">2018–2022</span>
            <h3>B.Tech – IIIT Manipur</h3>
            <p>
              I completed my four-year Bachelor of Technology degree
              in Electronics and Communication Engineering at the
              Indian Institute of Information Technology, Manipur.
            </p>
            <p>
              My undergraduate years strengthened my fundamentals
              in electronics, communication systems and engineering.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">EARLY PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</span>
            <h3>Beginning My Industry Journey</h3>
            <p>
              After completing B.Tech, I started gaining professional
              experience in the electronics industry.
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Dixon Technologies:</strong>
                Worked as a PCB Design Trainee for approximately six months.
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>Bosch:</strong>
                Gained backend-role professional experience for approximately
                three months.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              These experiences gave me an initial understanding
              of industry environments and practical engineering work.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">2021–2026</span>
            <h3>The GATE Preparation Journey</h3>
            <p>
              My GATE preparation journey started in 2021.
              My first attempt did not produce the result I expected.
              I tried again in 2022, but I still had not achieved my goal.
            </p>
            <p>
              Instead of giving up, I continued working on my
              fundamentals, analysing my mistakes and improving
              my preparation strategy.
            </p>
            <div class="highlight-box">
              <strong>My GATE milestones</strong>
              <p>
                Successfully qualified GATE ECE in 2024, 2025
                and 2026.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p>
              These experiences taught me that an unsuccessful attempt
              does not define an entire career.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">2024–2026</span>
            <h3>M.Tech – SVNIT Surat</h3>
            <p>
              Following my GATE qualification, I secured admission
              to the M.Tech programme in Communication Systems at
              Sardar Vallabhbhai National Institute of Technology,
              Surat.
            </p>
            <p>
              Although my specialization was Communication Systems,
              my strongest technical interest was in VLSI, semiconductor
              devices and circuit design.
            </p>
            <p>
              I independently explored additional technologies
              and programming skills, including:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>Verilog HDL and RTL Design</li>
              <li>SystemVerilog</li>
              <li>Python Programming</li>
              <li>C and Basic C++</li>
              <li>Digital Design and Circuit Concepts</li>
              <li>Semiconductor Device Physics</li>
              <li>TCAD Simulation</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">SEMICONDUCTOR RESEARCH</span>
            <h3>Exploring Nanoscale Transistor Technology</h3>
            <p>
              One of the most exciting parts of my postgraduate journey
              was my research interest in nanoscale semiconductor devices.
            </p>
            <p>
              I explored different technology nodes, including:
            </p>
            <div class="technology-tags">
              <span>22 nm</span>
              <span>14 nm</span>
              <span>7 nm</span>
              <span>3 nm</span>
            </div>
            <p>
              My M.Tech thesis focused on the performance assessment
              of nanoscale transistor devices, with particular emphasis
              on 3 nm technology.
            </p>
            <p>
              I worked with TCAD tools and Technology Command Language
              (Tcl) scripting to investigate device structures
              and performance characteristics.
            </p>
            <p>
              I also explored advanced transistor architectures:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>FinFET – Fin Field-Effect Transistor</li>
              <li>GAAFET – Gate-All-Around Field-Effect Transistor</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              This work developed my interest in advanced semiconductor
              technologies and transistor scaling below the 5 nm range.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">INDUSTRY RESEARCH EXPERIENCE</span>
            <h3>Philips India Ltd. – Pune</h3>
            <p>
              During my M.Tech programme, I secured an internship
              opportunity at Philips India Ltd., Pune, during my
              third semester.
            </p>
            <p>
              I continued exploring semiconductor device concepts,
              including FinFET and GAAFET architectures, and presented
              my technical work during my final-semester presentation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">ACADEMIC ACHIEVEMENT</span>
            <h3>Research Publication & M.Tech Excellence</h3>
            <p>
              I completed my M.Tech with an excellent academic grade
              and secured third rank in my overall batch for
              2024–2026.
            </p>
            <p>
              I also contributed to a book chapter accepted for
              publication by Wiley, with publication expected
              in January 2027.
            </p>
            <div class="highlight-box">
              <strong>Academic milestone</strong>
              <p>
                Overall 3rd rank in the M.Tech batch, 2024–2026.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">DOCTORAL RESEARCH OPPORTUNITIES</span>
            <h3>Exploring Ph.D. Opportunities</h3>
            <p>
              After my postgraduate research, I explored doctoral
              opportunities at several leading Indian institutions.
            </p>
            <p>I received interview calls from:</p>
            <div class="institution-grid">
              <span>IIT Delhi</span>
              <span>IIT Bombay</span>
              <span>IISc Bengaluru</span>
              <span>IIT Roorkee</span>
              <span>IIT Guwahati</span>
              <span>IIT Kanpur</span>
            </div>
            <p>
              I was selected for a Ph.D. position in the ECE Department
              at the Indian Institute of Science (IISc), Bengaluru.
              However, due to personal circumstances, I could not
              join the programme.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <span class="timeline-label">PROFESSIONAL OPPORTUNITY</span>
            <h3>RF & VLSI Engineering – IIT Kanpur</h3>
            <p>
              I was subsequently selected for an RF and VLSI Engineering
              opportunity at IIT Kanpur through the campus recruitment
              process.
            </p>
            <p>
              This opportunity represented another important milestone
              in my professional journey and my continued interest
              in RF systems, VLSI and hardware engineering.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TECHNICAL INTERESTS -->
    <section class="achievement-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading center">
          <span class="eyebrow">TECHNICAL INTERESTS</span>
          <h2>Areas I Love Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="interest-grid">
          <div class="interest-card">VLSI Design</div>
          <div class="interest-card">Semiconductor Devices</div>
          <div class="interest-card">RF Engineering</div>
          <div class="interest-card">Verilog & RTL Design</div>
          <div class="interest-card">FPGA Development</div>
          <div class="interest-card">Communication Systems</div>
          <div class="interest-card">Embedded Systems</div>
          <div class="interest-card">Python & Programming</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ACEGATE MISSION -->
    <section class="section container" id="acegate">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHY ACEGATE ECE?</span>
        <h2>Turning My Learning Journey Into a Learning Platform</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>
          Throughout my academic journey, I experienced the challenges
          of engineering education, competitive examinations and
          independent technical learning.
        </p>

        <p>
          I understand that many students, particularly those from
          rural backgrounds and financially constrained families,
          may not always have access to structured resources and
          proper academic guidance.
        </p>

        <p>
          That is one of the reasons I started ACEgate ECE.
          I want to create a platform where students can learn
          engineering concepts systematically, practise questions
          and develop confidence in their preparation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="resource-grid">
        <div class="resource-card">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Structured Courses</h3>
          <p>Subject-wise ECE learning resources and explanations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resource-card">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Complete Theory</h3>
          <p>Concepts, derivations and important engineering fundamentals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resource-card">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Solved Questions</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step solutions to strengthen problem-solving skills.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resource-card">
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>GATE Practice</h3>
          <p>Previous-year questions, quizzes and practice tests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PERSONAL PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="philosophy-section">
      <div class="container philosophy-container">
        <span class="eyebrow">MY PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h2>Your Starting Point Does Not Determine Your Destination.</h2>
        <p>
          I strongly believe that discipline is more powerful than
          temporary motivation. Consistency, patience and continuous
          learning can transform an individual's journey.
        </p>
        <div class="philosophy-points">
          <span>Discipline over motivation</span>
          <span>Consistency over temporary effort</span>
          <span>Learning from every failure</span>
          <span>Curiosity beyond the syllabus</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MESSAGE TO STUDENTS -->
    <section class="section container">
      <div class="student-message">
        <span class="eyebrow">A MESSAGE TO GATE ECE ASPIRANTS</span>
        <h2>Dear Students,</h2>
        <p>
          If you are preparing for GATE ECE and have faced unsuccessful
          attempts, academic difficulties or a lack of resources,
          remember that one examination result does not define
          your entire future.
        </p>
        <p>
          I have also experienced unsuccessful attempts. I understand
          what it feels like to prepare, appear for an examination
          and not achieve the expected result.
        </p>
        <p>
          But I continued. Keep strengthening your fundamentals,
          solve problems regularly, analyse your mistakes and remain
          consistent with your preparation.
        </p>
        <p>
          You do not need to have everything figured out today.
          You only need to keep moving forward.
        </p>
        <h3>Master ECE. Crack GATE. Build Your Future.</h3>
        <strong>With best wishes,<br />Aklesh Kumar</strong>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOCIAL PROFILES -->
    <section class="social-section">
      <div class="container center">
        <span class="eyebrow">LET'S CONNECT</span>
        <h2>Follow the ACEgate ECE Journey</h2>
        <p>Stay connected for engineering learning resources and updates.</p>

        <div class="social-links">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@AceGATEECE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/acegate_ece/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/aklesh-kumar/AcegateECE_Web" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  .author-page {
    color: #111827;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .container {
    width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 90px 0;
    background: linear-gradient(125deg, #eef2ff, #ffffff 75%);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #5145e5;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 18px 0;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 650px;
    color: #536078;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #5145e5;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #4035c9;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    border: 1px solid #c7c8ff;
    color: #5145e5;
    background: white;
  }

  .profile-card {
    padding: 35px 25px;
    text-align: center;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.06);
  }

  .profile-placeholder {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 145px;
    height: 145px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5145e5, #8b83ff);
    color: white;
    font-size: 44px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .profile-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 27px;
  }

  .profile-card p {
    color: #536078;
  }

  .profile-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #eef2ff;
    color: #5145e5;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .section {
    padding-top: 75px;
    padding-bottom: 75px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .section-heading.center,
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .philosophy-container h2,
  .social-section h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 38px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .section-heading > p,
  .social-section p {
    color: #64748b;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .intro-text {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .intro-text p,
  .timeline-content p {
    color: #536078;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .achievement-section {
    padding: 75px 0;
    background: #f8faff;
  }

  .achievement-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 35px;
  }

  .achievement-card {
    padding: 28px 16px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: white;
  }

  .achievement-card strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #5145e5;
    font-size: 30px;
  }

  .achievement-card span {
    color: #536078;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 50px auto 0;
    padding-left: 34px;
    border-left: 2px solid #dfe2ff;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    padding: 0 0 42px 25px;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 4px;
    left: -43px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 4px solid white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #5145e5;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #5145e5;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: white;
  }

  .timeline-label {
    color: #5145e5;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  .timeline-content ul {
    padding-left: 22px;
    color: #536078;
    line-height: 2;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 18px;
    border-left: 4px solid #5145e5;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #f4f5ff;
  }

  .highlight-box strong {
    color: #5145e5;
  }

  .highlight-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .technology-tags,
  .institution-grid,
  .interest-grid,
  .philosophy-points,
  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .technology-tags span,
  .institution-grid span,
  .philosophy-points span {
    padding: 9px 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #eef2ff;
    color: #5145e5;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .institution-grid {
    margin: 18px 0;
  }

  .interest-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    margin-top: 35px;
  }

  .interest-card {
    padding: 22px 14px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: white;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .resource-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 35px;
  }

  .resource-card {
    padding: 23px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 13px;
  }

  .resource-card > span {
    color: #5145e5;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .resource-card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .resource-card p {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .philosophy-section {
    padding: 85px 0;
    background: #111827;
    color: white;
  }

  .philosophy-container {
    max-width: 850px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .philosophy-container h2 {
    margin: 18px 0;
    color: white;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 45px);
  }

  .philosophy-container > p {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .philosophy-points {
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .philosophy-points span {
    background: #263248;
    color: #e0e7ff;
  }

  .student-message {
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: #fafaff;
  }

  .student-message h2 {
    margin: 18px 0;
    font-size: 29px;
  }

  .student-message p {
    color: #536078;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .student-message h3 {
